      "hizbQuarter": 165,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3505,
      "text": "The revelation of the Book, about which there is no doubt, is from the Lord of the worlds.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 32,
        "name": "سُورَةُ السَّجۡدَةِ",
        "englishName": "As-Sajda",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Prostration",
        "numberOfAyahs": 30,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 2,
      "juz": 21,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 415,
      "ruku": 358,
      "hizbQuarter": 165,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3506,
      "text": "Or do they say, “He has fabricated it.”? No, it is the truth from your Lord so that you may warn a people to whom no warner has come before you, in order that they may be guided.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 32,
        "name": "سُورَةُ السَّجۡدَةِ",
        "englishName": "As-Sajda",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Prostration",
        "numberOfAyahs": 30,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 3,
      "juz": 21,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 415,
      "ruku": 358,
      "hizbQuarter": 165,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3507,
      "text": "It is Allah Who created the heavens and earth and all that is between them in six Days, then rose over the Throne[2]. You have no protector or intercessor other than Him. Will you not then take heed?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 32,
        "name": "سُورَةُ السَّجۡدَةِ",
        "englishName": "As-Sajda",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Prostration",
        "numberOfAyahs": 30,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 4,
      "juz": 21,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 415,
      "ruku": 358,
      "hizbQuarter": 165,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3508,
      "text": "He manages every matter from the heaven to the earth, then everything ascends to Him on a Day the length of which is a thousand years by your reckoning.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 32,
        "name": "سُورَةُ السَّجۡدَةِ",
        "englishName": "As-Sajda",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Prostration",
        "numberOfAyahs": 30,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 5,
      "juz": 21,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 415,
      "ruku": 358,
      "hizbQuarter": 165,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3509,
      "text": "Such is the All-Knower of the unseen and the seen, the All-Mighty, the Most Merciful,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 32,
        "name": "سُورَةُ السَّجۡدَةِ",
        "englishName": "As-Sajda",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Prostration",
        "numberOfAyahs": 30,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 6,
      "juz": 21,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 415,
      "ruku": 358,
      "hizbQuarter": 165,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3510,
      "text": "Who perfected everything He created, and initiated the creation of man[3] from clay.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 32,
        "name": "سُورَةُ السَّجۡدَةِ",
        "englishName": "As-Sajda",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Prostration",
        "numberOfAyahs": 30,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 7,
      "juz": 21,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 415,
      "ruku": 358,
      "hizbQuarter": 165,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3511,
      "text": "Then He made his progeny from the extract of a worthless fluid.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 32,
        "name": "سُورَةُ السَّجۡدَةِ",
        "englishName": "As-Sajda",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Prostration",
        "numberOfAyahs": 30,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 8,
      "juz": 21,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 415,
      "ruku": 358,
      "hizbQuarter": 165,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3512,
      "text": "Then He fashioned him and breathed into him of His spirit[4]. He granted you hearing, sight and intellect; yet little it is that you give thanks.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 32,
        "name": "سُورَةُ السَّجۡدَةِ",
        "englishName": "As-Sajda",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Prostration",
        "numberOfAyahs": 30,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 9,
      "juz": 21,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 415,
      "ruku": 358,
      "hizbQuarter": 165,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3513,
      "text": "They say, “What! Is it that when we are disintegrated into the earth, will we then be created anew?” Rather, they deny the meeting with their Lord.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 32,
        "name": "سُورَةُ السَّجۡدَةِ",
        "englishName": "As-Sajda",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Prostration",
        "numberOfAyahs": 30,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 10,
      "juz": 21,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 415,
      "ruku": 358,
      "hizbQuarter": 165,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3514,
      "text": "Say, “The angel of death, who is in charge of you, will take your souls, then to your Lord you will be brought back.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 32,
        "name": "سُورَةُ السَّجۡدَةِ",
        "englishName": "As-Sajda",
